abstract: "Reference stack for the hardware lane of a layered AI-safety architecture: silicon root of trust, attestation verifier, Layer 4 control plane with one-time action tickets, signed Merkle-checkpointed audit trail, NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform adapter, and a 66-attack harness. Software is licensed under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; documentation, data and figures under CC BY-NC 4.0. Attribution is required; commercial use requires a separate license (see LICENSING.md)."
